### 6. Competitive Landscape

*Note: I'm drawing on training knowledge here rather than a live search — recommend a quick verification pass on current SERPs before publishing.*

**What exists on "human in the loop":**
The dominant content treats "human in the loop" as an AI safety and model oversight concept — Anthropic, MIT, Harvard Business Review, and NIST publications. These are primarily about model governance and responsible AI, not organizational workflow design. None approach the reframe Clauddio offers (humans have their own loops; AI inserts into those).

